---
title: Placing an order (POST /api/v1/order)
---
flowchart TB
    client[Client]
    middleware[CorrelationIdMiddleware]
    auth[JWT bearer authentication<br/>+ rate limit per customer]
    controller[OrderController<br/>customer id from the token]
    validate[PlaceOrderRequestValidator]
    handler[PlaceOrderRequestHandler]
    gateway[Payment gateway<br/>Card / PayPal / BankTransfer]
    provider(Payment provider)
    database(dbOrder)

    hasHeader{CorrelationId header?}
    isAuthorized{Valid token with<br/>customer_id?}
    isValid{Request shape valid?<br/>Idempotency-Key present?}
    seenKey{Order with this<br/>Idempotency-Key?}
    sameRequest{Same request?<br/>normalised hash}
    canRetry{Earlier attempt failed<br/>with a provider error?}
    isSettled{Settled?}
    referencesValid{Products exist?<br/>Promotion code applicable?}
    isAccepted{Payment accepted?}

    badRequest((400))
    unauthorized((401 / 403))
    tooMany((429))
    created((201 Created<br/>Location: /order/id))
    replayed((original result<br/>Idempotent-Replayed: true))
    reused((422))
    inProgress((409))
    failed((402 / 409 / 503))

    client --> middleware
    middleware --> hasHeader
    hasHeader -->|missing| badRequest
    hasHeader -->|present| auth
    auth -->|over limit| tooMany
    auth --> isAuthorized
    isAuthorized -->|no| unauthorized
    isAuthorized -->|yes| controller
    controller --> validate
    validate --> isValid
    isValid -->|no: every error listed| badRequest
    isValid -->|yes| handler

    handler --> seenKey
    seenKey -->|yes| sameRequest
    sameRequest -->|no| reused
    sameRequest -->|yes| canRetry
    canRetry -->|yes: back to PendingPayment,<br/>charge the same order again| gateway
    canRetry -->|no| isSettled
    isSettled -->|no, first request still charging| inProgress
    isSettled -->|yes: no new charge| replayed
    seenKey -->|no| referencesValid
    referencesValid -->|no| badRequest

    referencesValid -->|yes: 1. save order as PendingPayment<br/>unique customer + Idempotency-Key| database
    handler -->|2. charge, provider Idempotency-Key = order id<br/>not cancelled if the client disconnects| gateway
    gateway -->|timeout / retry / circuit breaker| provider
    handler --> isAccepted

    isAccepted -->|yes: 3. save outcome + OrderPlaced outbox row<br/>in one transaction| database
    isAccepted -->|yes| created
    isAccepted -->|no: 3. save PaymentFailed + outcome| database
    isAccepted -->|no| failed
